23:["$","p",null,{"children":"Deliveries are dispatched across designated Sunyani delivery zones (including Fiapre, UENR Campus, Berlin Top, Kotokrom, and Sunyani Central). Delivery times (typically 25–45 minutes) are estimates influenced by kitchen load and traffic. Customers must provide an accurate phone number and delivery location. If our dispatch rider cannot reach the recipient after reasonable attempts, the order may be returned to the kitchen."}]
